B.1    How Sage implements the finite predicates
Section 9 reduces the rotation theorem to exact finite predicates. This appendix makes the
correspondence between those predicates and the Sage source directly inspectable. The excerpts
are copied in cleaned form from the executable identified in that section: diagnostics, return-
