Facet duals and the fixed-word quadratic program
The first excerpt constructs the ten dual vertices in the coordinate order (q1 , q2 , p1 , p2 ), imple-
ments ω0 , and forms the KKT system. The last four rows impose i βi ai = 0, while the final
